@@ -65,6 +65,19 @@ catalogued at [warcraft.wiki.gg][public-builds].
 - Dry-run mode for previewing changes
 - Automatic WoW executable detection on macOS
 
+### Universal macOS binaries
+
+Static patching validates and updates each architecture in a universal Mach-O
+file. Each selected pattern must appear exactly once per architecture, and its
+entire replacement must fit inside a data, constant, or C-string section.
+Ambiguous or incomplete matches fail before the output is written.
+
+Ed25519 patching follows the bytes present in the executable, including Wrath
+Classic clients. A dry run validates the complete patch in memory without
+writing a file. Updating these data fields does not establish that a particular
+client accepts a server's TLS certificate or completes login; verify that
+separately. Modified macOS app bundles also need a new code signature.
+
 ## Installation
 
 ### From Source
